        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nikii Daas, Domenico Dolce, Stefano Gabbana, Aamir Khan\n- Companies: Dolce & Gabbana, Spykar Jeans, Globus, Donear, Bombay Dyeing, Toyota, Gold Souk, Paaneri Sarees, Mag Wheels, Mikura Pearls\n- Products: Toyota Innova\n- Places: Dubai, Legnano\n\nFacts:\n- In 1985, Domenico Dolce and Stefano Gabbana founded Dolce & Gabbana in Legnano.\n- Dolce & Gabbana is an Italian luxury fashion house.\n- Nikii Daas appeared in campaigns for Spykar Jeans, Dolce & Gabbana, Globus, Donear suitings, Bombay Dyeing, Mag Wheels, Gold Souk in Dubai for Mikura Pearls, and Paaneri Sarees.\n- Nikii Daas also appeared in a campaign for the Toyota Innova car with Aamir Khan.",
